.SH "نام (NAME)"
kmousetool \- Accessibility tool to help click the mouse
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.HP \w'\fBkmousetool\fR\ 'u
\fBkmousetool\fR
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
KMouseTool
clicks the mouse whenever the mouse cursor pauses briefly\&. It was designed to help those with repetitive strain injuries, for whom pressing buttons hurts\&.
.PP
KMouseTool
can also be configured to wait for a specified time for a drag to begin, before unclicking the mouse\&. This way, you can use it for drag and drop operations as well\&.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.RS 4
More detailed user documentation is available from \m[blue]\fBhelp:/kmousetool\fR\m[]
(either enter this URL into Konqueror, or run
\fB\fBkhelpcenter\fR\fR\fB
\fR\fB\fIhelp:/kmousetool\fR\fR)\&.
.RE
.RS 4
kf6options(7)
.RE
.RS 4
qt6options(7)
.RE
.RS 4
There is also further information available at \m[blue]\fBthe KDE accessibility site\&.\fR\m[]\&\s-2\u[1]\d\s+2
.RE
